Z||000029||TRiAD||11-13-2001||08:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by westtexas:<BR><B>TRiAD, when you're through with the 2.8 development, how about a supercharger for the Cadillac 4.9? It really needs another 100 HP to be the perfect swap for me.  <P>Robert </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Robert, this is possible, but I'm not sure the ECU tuning will be developed enough to do it anytime soon. Last I checked, they weren't at 100% as a stand alone. <P>When the time comes, if they're up to it, I'd only need a so-equipped car for the prototype.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
